WEBVTT

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:09.670
Explosive Shoot

00:00:16.490 --> 00:00:19.810
Keep fighting chasing your dream

00:00:19.810 --> 00:00:23.140
with love, courage and friendship

00:00:23.140 --> 00:00:26.640
This Blade and I are one

00:00:26.640 --> 00:00:29.680
Spin as hard as you can until the limit

00:00:29.680 --> 00:00:32.780
BURNING SOUL

00:00:43.710 --> 00:00:46.200
The things I can't do alone

00:00:46.200 --> 00:00:50.140
are not impossible if you're with me

00:00:50.490 --> 00:00:52.960
Come with me

00:00:52.960 --> 00:00:56.280
to the ends of this world

00:00:58.070 --> 00:01:03.540
The Four Sacred Beasts are athletes of love

00:01:04.330 --> 00:01:07.100
Shine! Open your eyes!

00:01:07.100 --> 00:01:09.730
Dragoon  Dranzer  Draciel  Driger

00:01:09.730 --> 00:01:12.450
Awaken!

00:01:12.790 --> 00:01:16.060
Fly across the sky, my energy

00:01:16.060 --> 00:01:19.380
Rise up, Sacred Beast!

00:01:19.380 --> 00:01:22.830
To defeat all the enemies who stand in our way

00:01:22.830 --> 00:01:26.050
jump, bearing everyone's hopes

00:01:26.070 --> 00:01:29.090
SHINING SOUL

00:01:37.390 --> 00:01:40.060
Tsk! You won, again.

00:01:40.060 --> 00:01:42.960
Don't sulk, Nobuo. You've
gotten quite good yourself.

00:01:42.960 --> 00:01:45.200
That means nothing if I can't win.

00:01:45.200 --> 00:01:48.930
At this rate, those guys will be laughing at me all the way from overseas.

00:01:49.490 --> 00:01:51.340
Those guys overseas, huh...

00:01:51.340 --> 00:01:53.170
Who would that be?

00:01:53.360 --> 00:01:55.320
A shorty with an insolent—

00:01:57.610 --> 00:01:59.020
T-Takao!

00:01:59.360 --> 00:02:01.070
Long time no see!

00:02:01.070 --> 00:02:02.330
Y-You..!

00:02:02.700 --> 00:02:04.580
You're back in Japan?!

00:02:06.320 --> 00:02:07.550
There we go.

00:02:07.760 --> 00:02:12.180
There's still some time before the world tournament, so I temporarily came back.

00:02:12.180 --> 00:02:13.450
Is that how it is?

00:02:13.450 --> 00:02:16.500
We thought you were already in America!

00:02:17.150 --> 00:02:21.410
Yeah. After all, that's what they were saying on the TV and in the newspaper.

00:02:21.770 --> 00:02:24.000
TV..? Newspaper..?

00:02:24.370 --> 00:02:27.140
Oh, of course you wouldn't know.

00:02:27.380 --> 00:02:28.900
Show it to him, Nobuo.

00:02:28.900 --> 00:02:29.500
Yeah.

00:02:31.160 --> 00:02:32.240
Here it is.

00:02:32.240 --> 00:02:33.390
Look at this.

00:02:35.120 --> 00:02:37.470
What? It's a newspaper, so what..?

00:02:41.730 --> 00:02:46.770
Don't Lose! Small Blader

00:02:47.360 --> 00:02:51.990
<i>Men</i>

00:02:52.110 --> 00:02:52.710
Good.

00:02:54.690 --> 00:02:56.000
Takao-kun's grandpa!

00:03:00.080 --> 00:03:04.160
Professor-kun, I hear that you helped Takao a lot in China. Thanks for that.

00:03:04.160 --> 00:03:06.710
No way, I didn't do anything.
It's quite the opposite.

00:03:06.710 --> 00:03:10.740
I see, I see.
By the way, are you alone today?

00:03:10.740 --> 00:03:13.700
Where are the other kids of the BBA team?

00:03:14.580 --> 00:03:17.360
Rei is busy training in America.

00:03:17.360 --> 00:03:20.230
Max and Kai have gone back to their families.

00:03:20.230 --> 00:03:24.210
Oh, I see. You can find Takao in the inner garden.

00:03:24.210 --> 00:03:26.600
Akira-kun and Nobuo-kun are here as well.

00:03:26.600 --> 00:03:28.360
Really?

00:03:30.490 --> 00:03:32.360
Thank you very much!

00:03:39.940 --> 00:03:44.270
I would ask you to refer to me as Star Kinomiya from now on, thank you very much.

00:03:49.290 --> 00:03:52.240
Hello? Is anybody home?

00:03:52.240 --> 00:03:53.900
W-What are you doing?

00:03:53.900 --> 00:03:57.590
I thought that coming back to Japan after so long made you lose your mind.

00:03:57.590 --> 00:03:59.620
What are you on about?! Look at this!

00:04:04.920 --> 00:04:06.260
I had no idea..!

00:04:06.260 --> 00:04:10.240
Well? Amazing, isn't it?
Look at this huge article!

00:04:10.240 --> 00:04:12.420
We've become quite the celebrities.

00:04:14.230 --> 00:04:17.460
Come on! Don't start putting up airs now!

00:04:17.730 --> 00:04:21.950
Don't be so hard on him,
this is his first vacation in awhile.

00:04:21.950 --> 00:04:23.540
That may be so, but...

00:04:23.540 --> 00:04:24.550
I know!

00:04:25.870 --> 00:04:29.460
I'll show you something cool. Follow me!

00:04:29.710 --> 00:04:31.700
Something cool? Alright!

00:04:32.480 --> 00:04:34.290
Wait for me!

00:04:34.520 --> 00:04:36.080
Gotta take this with me!

00:04:38.260 --> 00:04:40.620
This way! Come on, hurry!

00:04:46.690 --> 00:04:47.960
Takao...

00:04:48.500 --> 00:04:51.080
Hurry, hurry! This way!

00:04:51.080 --> 00:04:52.380
Okay!

00:05:01.450 --> 00:05:02.730
That Takao...

00:05:13.440 --> 00:05:14.720
There, look at that!

00:05:17.170 --> 00:05:21.010
What's that crowd? Are they all BeyBattling?

00:05:21.010 --> 00:05:22.470
Yeah, they are.

00:05:23.000 --> 00:05:26.960
With the success of the BBA team,
a lot of new fans have popped up.

00:05:27.310 --> 00:05:30.980
Could this mean...
that I have a lot of fans too?

00:05:30.980 --> 00:05:32.020
You could say that.

00:05:32.180 --> 00:05:34.230
Yahoo!

00:05:46.290 --> 00:05:48.790
Wow, there's really a lot of people.

00:05:48.790 --> 00:05:50.200
Impressive.

00:05:51.880 --> 00:05:54.790
Wow, the level here is pretty high too.

00:05:57.980 --> 00:05:59.810
Say, say, say, say, say.

00:05:59.810 --> 00:06:02.710
Doesn't this person look like
Takao-san from the BBA team?

00:06:04.130 --> 00:06:07.710
Ah, dang it. I got found out, didn't I.

00:06:07.710 --> 00:06:11.300
Nope, Takao-san was much better looking on TV.

00:06:11.300 --> 00:06:12.590
Oh, you're right.

00:06:12.590 --> 00:06:14.420
He's a fake.

00:06:14.420 --> 00:06:15.840
He's cosplaying.

00:06:17.490 --> 00:06:18.280
Let's go.

00:06:18.280 --> 00:06:18.890
Yeah.

00:06:18.890 --> 00:06:21.610
I-I'm a fake..?

00:06:22.070 --> 00:06:23.570
What's going on?

00:06:23.570 --> 00:06:24.330
Really,

00:06:24.660 --> 00:06:26.170
what's going on?

00:06:26.170 --> 00:06:28.030
Oh, that's right.

00:06:28.500 --> 00:06:32.660
According to the media, you should already be in America,

00:06:32.660 --> 00:06:35.760
so people don't believe the
real thing could be here.

00:06:36.060 --> 00:06:38.430
Tsk. Is that how it is..?

00:06:38.430 --> 00:06:39.950
That's boring.

00:06:41.030 --> 00:06:42.390
Professor.

00:06:43.870 --> 00:06:47.160
You came here just to give it
to me? Thanks a bunch, man.

00:06:48.600 --> 00:06:51.380
Who the heck do you think you are?
Seriously...

00:06:52.400 --> 00:06:56.020
Up until a moment ago, Dragoon was laying on the ground covered in dust!

00:06:56.020 --> 00:06:58.150
After you dropped him off your high horse!

00:06:58.420 --> 00:07:02.160
Isn't this Bey your friend that fought so many battles with you in China?!

00:07:02.160 --> 00:07:03.970
How could you treat him like that?!

00:07:03.970 --> 00:07:06.850
I-I got a tiny bit full of myself. I guess.

00:07:06.850 --> 00:07:08.580
Seriously, this is beyond pathetic.

00:07:08.950 --> 00:07:12.520
Leaving your Beyblade like that
and acting like you're a big star...

00:07:12.520 --> 00:07:15.540
Takao! If you keep this up, you fail as a Blader!

00:07:16.620 --> 00:07:19.040
You didn't need to go that far!

00:07:19.040 --> 00:07:21.280
Oh yes I do!
I haven't gone far enough, in fact!

00:07:21.280 --> 00:07:23.550
Someone who abandons their Beyblade is—

00:07:23.550 --> 00:07:25.880
When the heck did I abandon my Bey?!

00:07:34.500 --> 00:07:35.600
Takao.

00:07:36.060 --> 00:07:37.790
I-I didn't mean that.

00:07:37.790 --> 00:07:40.420
You were being so persistent... My hand slipped.

00:07:41.680 --> 00:07:42.780
I can't believe you.

00:07:43.550 --> 00:07:44.960
Professor...

00:07:46.340 --> 00:07:50.010
As things are now, I can't leave Dragoon to you.

00:07:51.030 --> 00:07:52.490
Professor!

00:07:52.970 --> 00:07:54.420
H-Hey!

00:07:54.420 --> 00:07:56.260
Come back, Professor!

00:07:57.490 --> 00:08:00.240
Takao, you <i>were</i> being too stubborn.

00:08:00.240 --> 00:08:03.050
Maybe, but he didn't need to say it like that.

00:08:03.050 --> 00:08:05.140
You could have just apologized.

00:08:05.540 --> 00:08:09.660
What the..? You're on <i>his</i> side too?! Treating me like some kind of scoundrel...

00:08:09.660 --> 00:08:10.930
Stop it!

00:08:13.860 --> 00:08:15.020
Please, stop it!

00:08:17.480 --> 00:08:20.520
At this rate, my poor Bey will..!

00:08:20.720 --> 00:08:23.480
Nope, I'm going in for the kill.

00:08:26.840 --> 00:08:28.410
Finish him!

00:08:34.880 --> 00:08:37.120
He tore apart his opponent's Bey!

00:08:39.620 --> 00:08:41.590
Victory!

00:08:45.720 --> 00:08:48.420
And that makes one more star for me!

00:08:49.390 --> 00:08:53.680
What a bully.
You didn't need to go that far, did you? Jeez.

00:08:53.680 --> 00:08:56.700
Yeah, he won already. You didn't
need to break his precious Bey.

00:08:56.700 --> 00:08:58.610
Shut up! Ya got a problem?!

00:09:00.800 --> 00:09:03.780
His 'precious Bey'?
Bullcrap.

00:09:03.780 --> 00:09:05.320
Look at my Bey!

00:09:05.540 --> 00:09:08.820
Look at this majestic figure
that has won battle after battle!

00:09:09.360 --> 00:09:13.330
You should prepare yourself
if you're gonna fight against me.

00:09:14.090 --> 00:09:16.170
That guy is going too far.

00:09:16.170 --> 00:09:18.710
Because he's not taking care of his Bey?

00:09:19.960 --> 00:09:22.040
Why are you looking at me like that?

00:09:23.910 --> 00:09:24.990
My...

00:09:25.640 --> 00:09:27.460
My Bey has...

00:09:49.960 --> 00:09:50.770
Who are you?

00:09:51.280 --> 00:09:53.500
That was pretty bad.

00:09:54.850 --> 00:09:56.450
Who are you, <i>oniichan</i>?

00:09:58.150 --> 00:10:00.450
W-Who I am doesn't matter now, does it?

00:10:00.450 --> 00:10:02.500
Anyway, I'm sorry to say but...

00:10:03.120 --> 00:10:06.340
This Attack Ring is not going to fit in anymore.

00:10:06.830 --> 00:10:08.260
Thank you.

00:10:08.260 --> 00:10:10.160
But I'm going to fix it!

00:10:11.630 --> 00:10:15.170
I received this Bey for my birthday
after wishing for it for so long!

00:10:18.080 --> 00:10:21.240
I was so happy that I could
finally play with all my friends.

00:10:21.680 --> 00:10:24.740
I took great care of it each and every day!

00:10:25.280 --> 00:10:27.570
You were really caring for it, huh.

00:10:28.120 --> 00:10:29.230
Isn't that...

00:10:29.520 --> 00:10:31.000
Isn't that obvious?

00:10:31.270 --> 00:10:32.950
Y-Yeah...

00:10:33.420 --> 00:10:39.140
Someone like Kouji-kun who doesn't care for his or someone else's Bey,

00:10:39.140 --> 00:10:42.710
I... I just can't forgive them!

00:10:43.820 --> 00:10:46.450
That hit a bit too close to home.

00:10:50.020 --> 00:10:52.400
Alright, leave everything to me!

00:10:53.600 --> 00:10:54.720
What?

00:10:54.930 --> 00:10:58.890
I'll talking about your Bey. I'll look after it.

00:10:58.890 --> 00:10:59.970
Okay?

00:11:11.170 --> 00:11:14.480
I wish you could take some time off to rest.

00:11:14.480 --> 00:11:16.960
Don't worry about me, Papa.

00:11:16.960 --> 00:11:18.990
I'm totally fine.

00:11:19.250 --> 00:11:23.170
But still, aren't you tired from all the travels?

00:11:23.170 --> 00:11:27.000
Going from the Japanese tournament to the Chinese one with no time to rest...

00:11:27.190 --> 00:11:29.850
No, I don't feel tired at all.

00:11:29.850 --> 00:11:31.270
I'm okay!

00:11:31.270 --> 00:11:35.710
I want to go to America right away. When I get there, I'll be able to see Mama!

00:11:35.710 --> 00:11:36.820
Oh yeah...

00:11:37.460 --> 00:11:38.720
To see Mama...

00:11:39.170 --> 00:11:40.720
You'll be able to see Judy.

00:11:41.110 --> 00:11:43.840
I haven't seen her in such a long time.

00:11:43.840 --> 00:11:46.270
So I'm looking forward to meeting her again.

00:11:46.820 --> 00:11:48.980
I'm getting excited already!

00:11:49.540 --> 00:11:51.980
I'm sure Mama feels the same way.

00:11:53.380 --> 00:11:57.440
I think so too.
If you meet her, you'll find out for sure.

00:11:59.060 --> 00:12:00.000
I just know it.

00:12:00.400 --> 00:12:03.250
Yep. If I just close my eyes...

00:12:03.820 --> 00:12:08.450
I can feel Mama's voice, her heart, her smile...

00:12:08.890 --> 00:12:12.220
I can hear her calling my name.

00:12:12.220 --> 00:12:14.920
Like "Max-chan!"

00:12:14.920 --> 00:12:16.830
Max-chan!

00:12:18.900 --> 00:12:20.690
How are you doing?

00:12:20.850 --> 00:12:22.400
Takao...

00:12:23.490 --> 00:12:25.280
Where's the Professor?

00:12:25.940 --> 00:12:30.210
W-Well, who knows?
Life is full of surprises.

00:12:30.210 --> 00:12:31.890
You had a fight, didn't you.

00:12:31.890 --> 00:12:33.070
How'd you know?

00:12:33.450 --> 00:12:35.310
Well, anyway.

00:12:35.310 --> 00:12:39.890
I have a small favor to ask you, my dear Max-chan...

00:12:41.300 --> 00:12:42.400
Take a look at this.

00:12:42.610 --> 00:12:45.060
<i>Wow</i>, that's terrible!

00:12:45.060 --> 00:12:47.450
This Bey has gone trough a lot of pain!

00:12:47.450 --> 00:12:51.090
I know right? I thought the same think!

00:12:51.090 --> 00:12:51.920
So I was thinking...

00:12:52.140 --> 00:12:54.560
Say no more. I already know what you're geting at.

00:12:54.560 --> 00:13:00.420
'One word is enough to understand thirty things.'  Or was it ten? A hundred..? Well, it doesn't matter. I'm in.

00:13:00.880 --> 00:13:02.770
See? We're good.

00:13:02.770 --> 00:13:03.680
Yup!

00:13:03.690 --> 00:13:08.680
Spring waves its hand smiling,

00:13:08.680 --> 00:13:14.160
Summer spreads passion.

00:13:14.160 --> 00:13:19.060
Seasons pass one after the other,

00:13:19.060 --> 00:13:23.370
Fall and Winter are good friends.

00:13:24.960 --> 00:13:29.620
When there is a problem you can't solve,

00:13:29.620 --> 00:13:32.020
Trust, friendship, love and emotion

00:13:32.020 --> 00:13:33.570
Ow, ow, ow, ow...

00:13:33.570 --> 00:13:34.060
Trust, friendship, love and emotion

00:13:34.060 --> 00:13:36.960
Be careful! This is one of your Bey's parts, you know.

00:13:36.960 --> 00:13:38.080
Y-Yeah.

00:13:38.080 --> 00:13:38.470
Clouds keep flying across the sky,

00:13:38.470 --> 00:13:41.230
<i>Oniichan</i>, you really love Beys, don't you?

00:13:41.230 --> 00:13:42.480
Clouds keep flying across the sky,

00:13:42.480 --> 00:13:42.760
You care so much even for a single part.

00:13:42.760 --> 00:13:45.710
the sky keeps changing every second

00:13:45.710 --> 00:13:48.160
When you say it like that, I kind of feel ashamed.

00:13:48.160 --> 00:13:48.970
My eyes well up and tears stream down my face,

00:13:48.970 --> 00:13:50.100
Why is that?

00:13:50.100 --> 00:13:53.050
You see, earlier I was in high spirits and I forgot about my Bey. I was being a little inconsiderate.

00:13:53.050 --> 00:13:57.000
but they're not tears of sadness

00:13:57.250 --> 00:14:01.000
And when you said you
couldn't forgive someone like that...

00:14:01.000 --> 00:14:04.490
I realized just how stupid I had been.

00:14:04.930 --> 00:14:07.520
Your Bey is something you gotta take care of.

00:14:07.750 --> 00:14:11.010
When you're in a battle,
they're your one and only ally.

00:14:11.010 --> 00:14:13.010
I see you reflected on your action.

00:14:13.360 --> 00:14:14.210
Professor.

00:14:14.620 --> 00:14:17.370
It's not like I came here to see you.

00:14:17.370 --> 00:14:21.970
Max said he needed my knowledge as a Bey manufacturer, so here I am.

00:14:21.970 --> 00:14:25.020
Say, Professor... I'm sorry about earlier.

00:14:26.040 --> 00:14:27.360
Takao...

00:14:27.990 --> 00:14:29.300
You forgot something.

00:14:31.750 --> 00:14:32.770
Professor.

00:14:34.290 --> 00:14:38.020
Now then, let's do some
maintenance on this Bey.

00:14:46.210 --> 00:14:48.500
Okay, here we go. You ready?

00:14:48.500 --> 00:14:51.050
Three, two, one..

00:14:51.050 --> 00:14:52.640
Go... Shoot!

00:15:02.340 --> 00:15:05.590
Wow, this Bey is pretty good!

00:15:05.590 --> 00:15:07.590
It's doing great for a test run.

00:15:08.020 --> 00:15:09.940
It turned out real good.

00:15:09.940 --> 00:15:13.600
Of course, after all, <i>I </i>chose the parts.

00:15:14.020 --> 00:15:17.310
Wowie! This is the best!

00:15:17.310 --> 00:15:21.400
Uh? You already got a new Bey?

00:15:21.770 --> 00:15:22.940
Kouji...

00:15:26.400 --> 00:15:28.800
Want to get beaten by me again?

00:15:29.090 --> 00:15:29.870
Let's see here.

00:15:32.340 --> 00:15:34.370
Pssh! It's so worn-out!

00:15:34.900 --> 00:15:39.260
There's not even a point in beating
such a lame Bey. See ya, loser.

00:15:40.180 --> 00:15:41.270
Wait there.

00:15:42.770 --> 00:15:46.050
Yuu's Bey won't go down so easily, you know.

00:15:46.050 --> 00:15:50.450
Especially against someone like you, who doesn't take care of their own Bey.

00:15:51.030 --> 00:15:52.230
Oh really?

00:15:52.230 --> 00:15:54.770
Then how about a fight with me, huh, Yuu?

00:15:58.690 --> 00:16:00.780
Yeah, I'll fight you!

00:16:00.780 --> 00:16:03.280
Kouji-kun, I'll have a match against you.

00:16:03.970 --> 00:16:06.770
I'll be able to add one more star after this.

00:16:11.740 --> 00:16:13.540
Let's do our best together...

00:16:13.540 --> 00:16:15.760
My new comrade.

00:16:15.760 --> 00:16:17.490
I'll go with the countdown.

00:16:17.720 --> 00:16:20.120
Get ready for a repeat of yesterday's defeat!

00:16:20.120 --> 00:16:23.160
Three, Two, One!

00:16:23.160 --> 00:16:24.680
Go... Shoot!

00:16:31.600 --> 00:16:33.520
A one-sided offensive.

00:16:33.520 --> 00:16:35.100
Will Yuu be alright?

00:16:35.330 --> 00:16:36.720
Don't you worry.

00:16:36.720 --> 00:16:38.420
That's right.

00:16:38.420 --> 00:16:40.970
The one in danger is Kouji-kun's Bey.

00:16:47.150 --> 00:16:50.390
Why?! Why can't I take him down?!

00:16:50.580 --> 00:16:55.540
A Deight Disk on the heavy side, a stable axis and a smaller Attack Ring.

00:16:55.540 --> 00:16:59.130
In other words, Yuu-kun's Bey is a defensive type through and through.

00:16:59.130 --> 00:17:03.760
That's not all. All the parts have been put together with balance in mind.

00:17:03.760 --> 00:17:06.010
It's not going to break apart easily.

00:17:06.730 --> 00:17:09.760
Yuu himself is also using a
strategy based on endurance.

00:17:10.180 --> 00:17:12.160
He truly believes in his Bey's power.

00:17:12.160 --> 00:17:14.260
That's good. Keep it up!

00:17:15.780 --> 00:17:18.720
What are you doing?! Go at him! Keep attacking!

00:17:19.180 --> 00:17:21.260
Attack him more!

00:17:21.800 --> 00:17:25.410
Kouji-kun's strategy which
consists in a relentless offense...

00:17:25.410 --> 00:17:27.540
is only pushing the Bey over its limits.

00:17:27.540 --> 00:17:29.670
What awaits him is most likely...

00:17:35.430 --> 00:17:37.160
W-What's going on?!

00:17:37.330 --> 00:17:40.610
If he keeps pushing so hard, his Bey will...

00:17:53.380 --> 00:17:55.530
N-No way!

00:18:08.750 --> 00:18:09.890
He did it.

00:18:10.270 --> 00:18:11.560
He really did it!

00:18:11.560 --> 00:18:14.080
Yuu's Beyblade is incredible!

00:18:14.270 --> 00:18:17.800
I can't believe my Bey would get beaten!

00:18:17.800 --> 00:18:22.080
Kouji, you pushed your Bey over his limits.

00:18:22.260 --> 00:18:26.840
Not only did you not care about other people's Beys, you also didn't care about your own.

00:18:27.160 --> 00:18:30.840
Your Bey isn't just a tool,
it's a comrade that fights at your side.

00:18:31.580 --> 00:18:33.050
A comrade..?

00:18:34.400 --> 00:18:37.350
<i>Hey!</i> Don't feel down.

00:18:37.350 --> 00:18:40.210
You can still use your Bey if you fix it.

00:18:40.210 --> 00:18:41.340
Correct.

00:18:41.340 --> 00:18:43.780
We repaired Yuu-kun's Bey too.

00:18:44.120 --> 00:18:46.780
That's right! If you want, I can help out.

00:18:47.200 --> 00:18:48.040
Yuu...

00:18:48.340 --> 00:18:51.230
I studied hard.

00:18:51.230 --> 00:18:54.660
How to choose the right parts,
tweak your set-up and all that.

00:18:55.120 --> 00:18:57.260
Let's do this together!

00:18:57.730 --> 00:18:58.620
Yeah...

00:19:11.680 --> 00:19:14.440
Thank you very much for everything.

00:19:14.440 --> 00:19:17.310
It's fine, really. Don't worry.

00:19:17.310 --> 00:19:19.640
Uhm... Will you be back?

00:19:20.570 --> 00:19:23.570
Uh, no, uhm... That might be a problem.

00:19:23.570 --> 00:19:26.160
We're going to be overseas for some time.

00:19:26.450 --> 00:19:29.480
Yeah, with our precious comrades.

00:19:35.430 --> 00:19:37.040
Well then, see you.

00:19:38.660 --> 00:19:41.060
Yuu, were they..?

00:19:42.000 --> 00:19:43.500
Y-Yeah.

00:19:44.320 --> 00:19:47.000
Thanks, Takao-<i>niichan.</i>

00:19:47.370 --> 00:19:49.250
Take good care of that Bey, okay?

00:19:49.860 --> 00:19:51.720
<i>- Bye bye!
</i>- See you!

00:19:51.720 --> 00:19:53.000
Bye!

00:19:54.850 --> 00:19:57.440
That Yuu is really a kindhearted kid.

00:19:57.440 --> 00:20:02.690
Yuu-kun, Kouji-kun, and all the other kids playing on the riverside...

00:20:02.690 --> 00:20:06.820
One of them could become a fearsome rival in the future.

00:20:06.820 --> 00:20:08.510
That's true.

00:20:08.940 --> 00:20:11.530
When you put it like that, it sounds dreadful.

00:20:11.800 --> 00:20:15.040
Dreadful? I'm happy!

00:20:15.040 --> 00:20:18.240
I want to fight with more and more strong opponents.

00:20:18.240 --> 00:20:23.230
Alright! For their sake too, we just have to do our best at the World tournament.

00:20:23.500 --> 00:20:25.110
That's exactly right!

00:20:25.110 --> 00:20:26.800
All for one!

00:20:27.140 --> 00:20:29.120
We'll be rooting for you!

00:20:29.120 --> 00:20:30.490
Yeah!

00:20:39.650 --> 00:20:40.990
Kai.

00:20:40.990 --> 00:20:42.260
What?

00:20:42.640 --> 00:20:46.810
You understand, do you not?
Keep your eyes open in America.

00:20:47.030 --> 00:20:51.270
And find the Beys where the Sacred Beast dwell.

00:20:53.680 --> 00:20:55.760
That is your duty.

00:20:55.760 --> 00:20:56.980
Are we clear?

00:21:13.590 --> 00:21:18.000
You don't need to tell me.
I'll find the Sacred Beasts no matter what.

00:21:18.500 --> 00:21:20.020
And to do that,

00:21:20.540 --> 00:21:25.970
I will gladly sacrifice not only the
BBA team, but even my Dranzer!

00:21:26.300 --> 00:21:28.020
And then, surely..!

00:21:28.450 --> 00:21:29.760
Surely..!

00:21:39.960 --> 00:21:44.720
Spring waves its hand smiling,

00:21:44.720 --> 00:21:50.200
Summer spreads passion.

00:21:50.200 --> 00:21:55.350
Seasons pass one after the other,

00:21:55.350 --> 00:21:59.560
Fall and Winter are good friends.

00:22:01.000 --> 00:22:05.660
When there is a problem you can't solve,

00:22:05.660 --> 00:22:11.560
Trust, friendship, love and emotion

00:22:14.120 --> 00:22:18.800
Clouds keep flying across the sky,

00:22:18.800 --> 00:22:24.200
the sky keeps changing every second

00:22:24.200 --> 00:22:29.090
My eyes well up and tears stream down my face,

00:22:29.090 --> 00:22:33.090
but they're not tears of sadness

00:22:34.820 --> 00:22:39.420
I summon my courage and try to put it into words.

00:22:39.420 --> 00:22:44.770
"Let's go on a journey to the city of hope!"

00:22:44.770 --> 00:22:49.760
All your dreams will come true

00:22:58.290 --> 00:23:03.920
According to my analysis,
isn't that America, Land of the Free?

00:23:03.920 --> 00:23:08.360
We found out the existence of a research center where, using the national funds,

00:23:08.360 --> 00:23:12.170
they train Beybladers through
advanced scientific methods!

00:23:12.430 --> 00:23:17.440
No matter where I look, everything about that place is flashy and sparkling!

00:23:17.870 --> 00:23:20.980
Next time: Landing Onto a New Battlefield!

00:23:21.190 --> 00:23:23.880
This is all 'Oh my god!'-tier.
